---
import DownloadButtons from '../../components/DownloadButtons.astro'
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Livestream Overlay Maker: TikTok &amp; Shopee Live overlays with safe zones | Oia"
  description="Design 1080×1920 livestream overlays for TikTok and Shopee Live: price cards, freeship badges, countdown frames, transparent PNG, safe-zone guides built in. Free &amp; open source."
  ogTitle="Livestream Overlay Maker: TikTok &amp; Shopee Live | Oia"
  ogDescription="1080×1920 transparent overlays with safe-zone guides for TikTok and Shopee Live."
  canonical="https://oia.solutions/use-cases/livestream-overlays/"
  base="../../"
>
<header class="pageHero">
  <p class="kicker">Use case, live commerce</p>
  <h1>Overlays that dodge the UI.<br>Prices that change mid-stream.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Transparent 1080×1920 overlays with safe-zone guides built into the editor.</p>
  <DownloadButtons rowClass="ctaRow" anchorId="download" installHref="../../install/" ghost={{ href: '../../prompts/', label: 'Copy the prompts' }} />
</header>

<main class="pageMain">
  <div class="frame">
    <img loading="lazy" src="../../assets/livestream-example.webp" alt="Illustrated vertical livestream layout: a real transparent sale-price preset composited over a product image" width="900" height="1120">
    <span class="frameCaption mono">illustration · real overlay preset over an AI product image</span>
  </div>

  <div class="ucGrid">
    <div>
      <h2 class="catH" style="margin-top:8px">The overlay loop</h2>
      <div class="stepsList">
        <div><span class="n">01: PICK</span><h3>Overlay preset</h3><p>Price, freeship or countdown, 1080×1920 transparent.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">02: GUIDE</span><h3>Safe zones on</h3><p>Keep your card out of the hatched bands.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">03: REPRICE</span><h3>One prompt, same style</h3><p>Price drop mid-stream: ask, preview, apply.</p></div>
        <div><span class="n">04: EXPORT</span><h3>Transparent PNG</h3><p>Guides never reach the exported bytes.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="catH" style="margin-top:8px">Why it works</h2>
      <div class="factRow" role="group" aria-label="Overlay facts">
        <span>community-measured zones, not an official spec</span>
        <span>template prices are native text: edit free</span>
        <span>wrong ratio refused, honestly</span>
        <span>live covers 500×500 · 1080×1920</span>
        <span>countdown frames are static</span>
      </div>
      <div class="faq" style="margin-top:26px">
        <details><summary>What size is a TikTok livestream overlay?</summary><p>1080×1920 (9:16). Oia ships the preset with a transparent background and community-measured safe-zone guides so your card never hides behind TikTok's buttons and comments.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do the overlays export with transparency?</summary><p>Yes, PNG with alpha at 1080×1920, straight into OBS. The guides stay in the editor and never reach the exported bytes.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
</Page>
